{"unit_id":"ice-kele__dsh-llm-guardian#card-zh","repo":"ice-kele/dsh-llm-guardian","commit":"bc140288aa24c0f221dc8b0512a5c4fece08514c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH LLM Guardian 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的模型 Provider 管理插件。它在模型设置卡片中提供连通性检测和用量摘要，并通过 DSH 的模型流统计各 Provider 的 Token 使用量；达到本地额度或检测到 Provider 不可用时可拦截新请求。用户还能查询 Provider 账户或套餐用量，并在独立统计页按模型和日期查看会话 Token、消息、活跃天数、热力图与趋势。适合需要监控模型服务状态、控制本地用量或回顾使用情况的 DSH 用户。查询使用当前 Provider 配置，统计读取本机会话日志。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:641-669","lib/index.js:794-856","lib/index.js:385-416","lib/client.js:1840-1879"]}
{"unit_id":"ice-kele__dsh-llm-guardian#card-en","repo":"ice-kele/dsh-llm-guardian","commit":"bc140288aa24c0f221dc8b0512a5c4fece08514c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH LLM Guardian adds provider checks and quota summaries to DSH web settings. It counts model-stream tokens and can block requests at a local limit. Users can query provider balances or plan quotas and view local session usage by model and date, with token totals, messages, heatmaps, and trends.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:641-669","lib/index.js:794-856","lib/index.js:385-416","lib/client.js:1840-1879"]}
