{"unit_id":"ice-kele__dsh-llm-guardian#feature-1","repo":"ice-kele/dsh-llm-guardian","commit":"bc140288aa24c0f221dc8b0512a5c4fece08514c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH LLM Guardian 的功能「Provider 连通检测」：检查已配置模型服务的可用状态，并把结果显示在模型 Provider 卡片。用户点击卡片上的检测按钮可立即发起检查，插件也会按配置间隔周期检查。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:641-684","lib/client.js:630-685"]}
{"unit_id":"ice-kele__dsh-llm-guardian#feature-2","repo":"ice-kele/dsh-llm-guardian","commit":"bc140288aa24c0f221dc8b0512a5c4fece08514c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH LLM Guardian 的功能「本地 Token 额度」：按 Provider 累计模型流返回的 Token 使用量，并在设置页查看或重置计数、配置额度。启用守护后，达到额度时插件会拦截该 Provider 的新模型请求。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:790-856","lib/client.js:830-886"]}
{"unit_id":"ice-kele__dsh-llm-guardian#feature-3","repo":"ice-kele/dsh-llm-guardian","commit":"bc140288aa24c0f221dc8b0512a5c4fece08514c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH LLM Guardian 的功能「账户与套餐用量查询」：按 Provider 查询账户余额或套餐配额，并在 Provider 卡片和用量面板展示剩余量、使用量或分档额度。用户可立即查询，也可设置自动刷新间隔。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:698-765","lib/client.js:62-100","lib/client.js:815-883"]}
{"unit_id":"ice-kele__dsh-llm-guardian#feature-4","repo":"ice-kele/dsh-llm-guardian","commit":"bc140288aa24c0f221dc8b0512a5c4fece08514c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH LLM Guardian 的功能「本地会话统计」：从 DSH 会话事件汇总 Token、消息、会话数和模型分布。用量统计页面支持 7、30 或 90 天范围、模型筛选，并用热力图、按日趋势和模型占比展示结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:385-416","lib/index.js:419-518","lib/client.js:1585-1775"]}
{"unit_id":"ice-kele__dsh-llm-guardian#caveat-1","repo":"ice-kele/dsh-llm-guardian","commit":"bc140288aa24c0f221dc8b0512a5c4fece08514c","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH LLM Guardian 使用当前 Provider 配置查询账户或套餐用量；如 Provider 配置了凭据环境变量，host 会通过 DSH credentials 服务解析其密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:567-570","lib/index.js:698-717"]}
{"unit_id":"ice-kele__dsh-llm-guardian#caveat-2","repo":"ice-kele/dsh-llm-guardian","commit":"bc140288aa24c0f221dc8b0512a5c4fece08514c","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"本地统计页从 DSH 会话日志聚合数据，并将统计快照保存在 llm-guardian 设置中；可选择 7、30 或 90 天统计范围。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:522-550","lib/client.js:1632-1645","lib/client.js:1680-1775"]}
